  "objectDescription": "Form of the Import video dialog: the author's own screen recording of a B1 app is picked in the b1_file_upload (no auto upload); the client logic sends it in 8 MB chunks to /service/app/demo-factory/upload/{start,:id/chunk,:id/finish} — one request for the whole file does not get past Codespaces' port forwarding — showing progress in uploadStatus and putting the upload id into uploadId. Then \"Analyze & create demo\" calls import-video with the new demo's id, title and language. The analyze job cuts the recording into scenes at speech pauses and screen changes, transcribes the voice with ElevenLabs Speech-to-Text and saves the result as a video demo (scenes with clips of the recording instead of routes and browser actions).",
